# float_sqrt_fabs_methods - `sqrt` and `fabs` are methods of `f32` and
# `f64` (`(16.0).sqrt()`, `x.fabs()`), each at its own precision: a
# negative root is NaN, and `fabs` clears the sign bit, so `-0.0` gives
# `0.0`.
